{
  "comment": "Entry config for activitypod-js's local dev pod on :4000. dk's proven pivot import set (pivot-config/no-auth.json \u2014 mashlib UI removed, which is why the stock dev-http-subdomain.json will not compile here) with exactly two swaps: subdomain identifiers so each pod owns its host and can answer WebFinger for a handle, and webacl so ACLs are actually enforced \u2014 the agent's private trees are meaningless on an allow-all server.",
